Jim is asking Creed for $3 for Kelly's party.

1670
01:06:47.400 --> 01:06:48.100
Creed says, great.

1671
01:06:48.220 --> 01:06:49.160
I'd like to contribute.

1672
01:06:49.740 --> 01:06:52.580
And then he hands him a $3 bill.

1673
01:06:53.220 --> 01:06:53.560
Mm-hmm.

1674
