You know who I thought it was?

1681
01:07:05.260 --> 01:07:05.520
Who?

1682
01:07:06.020 --> 01:07:06.780
Brad Pitt.

1683
01:07:07.200 --> 01:07:07.640
No.

1684
01:07:07.960 --> 01:07:09.340
It looked like Brad Pitt to me.

1685
01:07:09.340 --> 01:07:14.340
And I thought maybe it was a nod to BJ because he was doing the movie with Brad Pitt.

1686
01:07:14.880 --> 01:07:15.180
Oh.

1687
01:07:15.500 --> 01:07:16.100
I don't know.

1688
