We were like, BJ, bring him to set.

1692
01:07:25.380 --> 01:07:26.620
Maybe he'd like to come have lunch.

1693
01:07:26.740 --> 01:07:27.000
Yeah.

1694
01:07:27.000 --> 01:07:28.320
We'll be totally cool, BJ.

1695
01:07:28.480 --> 01:07:29.540
We will be normal.

1696
01:07:29.980 --> 01:07:30.380
Exactly.

1697
