George W.

1711
01:07:55.140 --> 01:07:55.360
Bush.

1712
01:07:55.840 --> 01:07:56.200
What?

1713
01:07:56.200 --> 01:07:57.120
I don't know.

1714
01:07:57.240 --> 01:07:58.120
That's who Phil picked.

1715
01:07:58.260 --> 01:08:00.500
He said Phil made it, and that's who he put on it.

1716
01:08:00.740 --> 01:08:02.440
You thought George W.

1717
